Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:14.11,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Dear Mother and Father, \Nwho are in heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:17.54,Main,Warriors(adlibbed),0,0,0,,Can't wait to fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:25.12,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I might just die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:31.13,Main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,I want the first crack \Nat the Crystal Helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.26,Main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,No, you ornery pup, I'll go first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:37.64,Main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:43.65,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Who... Who... Who in the \Nworld are these people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:09.55,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2500,1725)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HFAFDFE&\3c&H3D6671&\4c&H372771&\shad2}T{\c&HF8FCFD&}h{\c&HF6FBFC&}e{\c&HF4FAFB&} {\c&HF2F9FA&}W{\c&HF1F8FA&}a{\c&HEFF7F9&}r{\c&HEDF6F8&}r{\c&HEBF5F7&}i{\c&HE9F4F6&}o{\c&HE7F3F5&}r{\c&HE5F2F4&} {\c&HE3F1F3&}P{\c&HE2F0F3&}r{\c&HE0EFF2&}i{\c&HDEEEF1&}n{\c&HDCEDF0&}c{\c&HDAECEF&}e{\c&HD8EBEE&}s{\c&HD6EAED&}s{\c&HD4E9EC&} {\c&HD3E7EC&}a{\c&HD1E6EB&}n{\c&HCFE5EA&}d{\c&HCDE4E9&} {\c&HCBE3E8&}t{\c&HC9E2E7&}h{\c&HC7E1E6&}e{\c&HC5E0E5&} {\c&HC4DFE5&}B{\c&HC2DEE4&}a{\c&HC0DDE3&}r{\c&HBEDCE2&}b{\c&HBCDBE1&}a{\c&HBADAE0&}r{\c&HB8D9DF&}i{\c&HB6D8DE&}c{\c&HB5D7DE&} {\c&HB3D6DD&}K{\c&HB1D5DC&}i{\c&HAFD4DB&}n{\c&HADD3DA&}g
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.71,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Preparations for a meeting, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:31.16,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Right. I've gathered the \Nelders of the various tribes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.16,0:02:34.35,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,so that I can introduce you to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:35.21,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,As for the venue...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:38.22,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Over there. Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.81,0:02:41.21,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,The original home of our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.21,0:02:43.72,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,the grand village overseen\Nby the Great Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:46.52,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Lakeside Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:50.73,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,The largest settlement in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:53.66,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I had noticed it in the distance, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:57.89,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you telling me \Nsuch crucial information?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:02:59.74,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Isn't it some sort of military secret?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.65,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,What are you worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.18,0:03:06.99,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Theoretically speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:11.71,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,If I were to escape \Nand be rescued by my forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:15.25,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,having knowledge of your \Nsettlements and territory...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:19.91,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Couldn't that potentially \Nlead to your destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.82,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am asking a serious question!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:32.92,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Or is it that you simply think \NI have no chance of escaping?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.69,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm underestimating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:44.03,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,But, Sera, weren't you \Nenchanted by my shaven face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.50,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,I was just confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:01.63,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do you need to keep dragging \Nthat back up? It's so childish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.35,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Embarrassed, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:04.77,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,That's so charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:05.66,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Charm...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.14,0:04:09.94,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Besides, your worries will be moot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.02,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,if you lose the desire \Nto return to your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.72,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,I've stated that my intent \Nis to make you my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.90,Flashback,Veor,0,0,0,,Which includes making \Nsure you fall for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:23.61,Flashback,Serafina,0,0,0,,Seriously, where does all \Nthis confidence come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:27.67,Flashback,Cersei,0,0,0,,They already sound like a couple...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:40.42,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Who... Who... Who in the \Nworld are these people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.70,0:04:44.80,Main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Master Thunder Voice! \NI ask your leave to battle this woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.30,Main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,My axe can't wait much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.81,Main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,Just once! I've got to fight her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:52.15,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,So, it's revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:56.31,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,For all of their fellow \Nbarbarians I've slain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:00.70,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,No need to be so tense, Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.70,0:05:02.82,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'll explain things to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:08.53,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,My brave warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:11.33,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I thank you for welcoming \Nthe Crystal Helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:18.34,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,But she is here today to \Nbreak bread with the elders!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:22.37,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,And while I understand your feelings when \Nfaced with such a powerful opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:23.95,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I ask that you calm yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:31.85,Main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,Well, if that's what Master\NThundering Voice says, so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:32.85,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.86,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,A-All that bloodlust... gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:35.16,Main - Top,Warriors (adlibbed),0,0,0,,Guess we got ahead of ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:41.38,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,A powerful opponent... did he mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:44.18,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What's going on here? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.73,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why have they all gathered here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:51.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,To welcome you, along with waiting \Nfor a chance to spar with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:55.03,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,They're waiting for a chance... to spar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:06:02.75,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Hang on, none of this makes any sense! \NShouldn't they be out for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:07.63,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Revenge? Were you really \Nworried about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.67,0:06:14.47,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,My brave warriors. Do any of you have \Na vendetta against the Crystal Helmet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:19.27,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,If not, then make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:28.15,Main,Warrior,0,0,0,,We warriors bear no ill will!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:34.16,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.09,0:06:39.75,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Surely they're just obeying the \Norders of the Great Chief's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.90,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Well, so be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:49.49,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a knight commander \Nof the Eastern Expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:52.93,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I cannot lose my composure, \Nregardless of the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:00.05,Main,Warrior A,0,0,0,,Crystal Helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:08.19,Main,Warrior A,0,0,0,,Your martial display from the \Nother day... was truly brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:09.24,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:11.41,Main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:14.33,Main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,To trade blows with Master Thundering \NVoice... You're a hell of a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.20,Main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,And a beauty, to boot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:18.62,Main,Warrior 1,0,0,0,,I wish she could've been my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:22.24,Main,Warriors,0,0,0,,I still remember those \Nblows that shattered stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:26.49,Main,Warriors,0,0,0,,A damn fine woman. Here's hoping she \Nbears some good, strong children!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:31.47,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?!\NDon't you realize I'm an enemy commander?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:34.77,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It's as I said. They bear you no grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:39.85,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,We have an appreciation \Nfor those who are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:45.97,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Those are the values of my people, \Nand in particular, these men.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:31.61,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Cersei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:33.78,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,What is it, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.03,0:08:36.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,That house happens to be boiling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.28,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You and Sera will enjoy their hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:45.17,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,What will you be doing in \Nthe meantime, Master Veor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:48.41,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Just a few errands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.41,0:08:51.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,I'll have an initial discussion \Nwith the elders, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:52.92,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,It won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:57.25,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,You there! People of this home!\NI am the Thundering Voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:08:59.50,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Master Thundering Voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.43,0:09:05.38,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:08.87,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sorry to suddenly call on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:11.46,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,but I ask that you share your \Nhot water with these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:14.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,The blond one is going to be my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:15.25,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wha—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:17.66,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Oh, well that's wonderful news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.12,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,My, my, my, and she's quite the beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:24.95,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,And she has the same color eyes \Nas the Great Chief's wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:35.00,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Well, it seems to me Master Thundering \NVoice is bound to be satisfied!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.55,0:09:38.55,Main - Top,Yufa,0,0,0,,Come right on in, don't be shy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:41.07,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-Wait! We just met! You're being \Ntoo familiar! Listen to me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.59,0:09:41.07,Main - Top,Veor,0,0,0,,Look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:50.97,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,I didn't mean any harm. \NHope you can forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.19,0:09:53.31,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.31,0:09:55.77,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Forgiveness is a knight's virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:58.95,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,It's nice that Master Thundering \NVoice has such a kind wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:01.19,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.20,Main,Regina,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:07.51,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Y'know, we should put \Nsome medicinal tea on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:08.50,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Could you grab it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:21.60,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Good boy, Gatar, remembering where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You put medicinal herbs in your tea...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:28.79,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Sure do. It's pretty common \Naround these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.88,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:34.11,Main,Regina,0,0,0,,But with these numbers, \Nwe'll need more hot water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.20,0:10:37.93,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Go turn the fire up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.63,0:10:41.49,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.82,0:10:43.99,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Off to grab some more firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:47.99,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,They seem awfully \Nsure-footed for their age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.99,0:10:50.37,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Solid foundations for a warrior, \Nin one so young...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:01.66,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,They're mostly just mimicking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:05.78,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Ena's been a good example\Nfor Gatar, lately, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:07.46,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,It's been a big relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:09.58,Main,Regina,0,0,0,,It works both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:14.90,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,So these two... aren't actually related?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:19.15,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Should be ready, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:21.99,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Here you are. \NDrink up before it cools, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:28.68,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:37.30,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Even a noble like yourself can appreciate \Nthe rustic flavor of this tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.82,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's got a very distinct aroma,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:42.29,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,but it's refreshing in a way \Nthat more than justifies it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:46.05,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Almost as if the medicinal herbs are \Nsoaking throughout my entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:51.33,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, the herbs are high quality, and \Ncome from the spirits of the Sacred Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.28,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,I'm real glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:57.03,Main,Regina,0,0,0,,Care for more?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:58.32,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:13.64,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are communal houses like this \Ncommon in barbarian territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:17.37,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You two don't seem to be related.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:20.46,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And I can't imagine it's just \Nthe four of you living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:23.59,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are your husbands some of the \Nwarriors that were outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:25.95,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:31.10,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,the truth is our husbands \Npassed away a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:37.22,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Mine died in the war, to the west, \Nwhile this one was still in my belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:41.36,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Got wounded in a bad way... \Nand that was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:50.99,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then they were victims of the \NEastern Expedition... of my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.14,0:12:54.83,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,It was necessary to secure\Nresources that our people need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.31,0:12:58.09,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,And a fight between soldiers \Non opposing sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:13:01.79,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,There's no need for me to feel \Nsympathy for these barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:07.64,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,If... only I could bring \Nmyself to believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:20.91,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I cannot offer apologies for the \Nlives lost in our army's expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,But I accept your hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:26.86,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I was defeated, and taken captive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:29.91,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You two have the right \Nto avenge your husbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.45,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:40.04,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Revenge... why would we want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:45.74,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You have to ask? \NThe one who took their lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:49.51,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It might have been me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:58.68,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,I'm a bit sad that my boy doesn't \Nremember his father's face,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:08.33,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,but he was lucky enough to be \Naside his father after he passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:15.35,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,And I was lucky enough \Nto be left with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:18.29,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,It ain't just war, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.61,0:14:22.46,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,The men, whether it's dragon \Nhunting, beast hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:24.55,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,sometimes even monster hunting...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:27.85,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,Either they get their limbs hurt \Nso bad they can't fight anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:30.30,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,or age and weaken until they get eaten...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:39.06,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,One way or another, \Nthey're gonna end up dying in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:43.65,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,So I really don't know what to do \Nwhen you look so torn up about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:48.32,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,The warriors from before, \Nand now these women...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.73,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do the barbarians really \Nview life and death
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:55.33,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,so differently than we do in Illdoren?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:08.55,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:09.97,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,A dragon whistle...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.32,0:15:11.56,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.13,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:47.88,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I-It's a type of dragon \Ncalled a Tsukebikeshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.65,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,When you make a fire in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:51.72,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,it tends to seek out the \Nsource of the smoke...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:54.51,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And that same habit led it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:59.70,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,But it's strange. The Tsukebikeshi \Naround here don't approach villages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:02.52,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,They've learned how they'll \Nbe attacked if they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:04.98,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Speculate later. For now, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.65,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,S-Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:12.71,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:14.16,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,We've got its attention, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.98,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,W-We need to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.50,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,If something were to happen to you, \NI couldn't face my master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:22.52,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.80,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Of all the idiotic—\Nare you trying to die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:27.63,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'd ask you the same, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:33.84,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You barbarians are too used \Nto the deaths of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.29,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,It gets on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:40.11,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, odd eyes... \Nactually, let me use your name...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.11,0:16:44.10,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Cersei. Who do you think \Nyou're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:48.81,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a knight commander of \Nthe kingdom of Illdoren—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:53.67,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Serafina de Lavillant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.61,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,W-With the fire tongs? That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:03.54,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be fighting a \Ndragon with that kind of—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.21,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Stop talking. You're a distraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:17.56,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, the first blow \Nmade it clear enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:23.31,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,This mockery of a bird is nothing \Ncompared to that bearded oaf's sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:27.28,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And more than that, as a \Nknight, if there are those
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.94,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,behind me, whom I must defend, \Nthen I will never retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:44.04,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there?! Run, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.63,Main,Yufa,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:47.10,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:52.09,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can deal with an enemy like this in the\N time it takes you all to get to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.72,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,And more than that, you're in the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.97,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,I-I'm going to mock you if you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.98,0:18:05.82,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Pay attention, bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.70,0:18:09.60,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,You get to deal with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:32.60,Main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Master Thundering Voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.60,0:18:34.42,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,How many of them entered the village?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.42,0:18:35.62,Main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Four of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:39.60,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,See if there's anyone who \Nwas unable to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:41.84,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Your first priority is \Nthe villagers' safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:42.89,Main,Warriors,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:48.92,Italics,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera was with Cersei. \NShe likely got away safely, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:51.98,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Let's put an end to these pests!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:07.26,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Where is the last one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.67,0:19:09.16,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:11.17,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Cersei?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.57,0:19:15.42,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,A... A Tsukebikeshi landed \Non the house from earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.43,0:19:19.67,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Miss Sera fought so we could get—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:24.60,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,So fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:36.19,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I thought I'd have more options out in \Nthe open, but it's faster than I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:53.03,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Not only that, but given \Nits focus on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:55.46,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,I have plenty of stamina left, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:12.63,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Charging at me the second \NI'm disarmed, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:14.41,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,A clever creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:21.03,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,After invading their lands...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.45,0:20:26.44,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,Showing mercy for the weak may \Nbe little more than hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:34.20,Italics,Serafina,0,0,0,,But now I will have lived, \Nand died, as a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:38.29,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Sera!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:39.80,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Cover your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.51,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Sera. I was running late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.49,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,As the next Great Chief,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.49,0:21:11.15,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,there are no thanks I can \Noffer you that are sufficient
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:14.71,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,to convey my gratitude for protecting \NCersei and the people of this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.43,0:21:21.46,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,But more than anything... \NI am truly relieved...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:24.72,Main,Veor,0,0,0,,that you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.23,0:21:35.48,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Huh? Why... What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.93,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why am I crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:40.65,Main,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.97,Main,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor!
